# game_class.md

## Overview
The **Game** class operates as the high-level coordinator for gameplay sessions. It owns the primary gameplay managers and drives their update cadence each frame.

## Responsibilities
- Construct and hold references to player, stage, encounter, and progression managers.
- Advance simulation ticks by delegating to each manager in the correct order.
- Provide a single entry point that the runtime instantiates during startup.

Legacy developer-only harnesses have been retired so production and test builds both launch through this class.
